<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!-- S87 THE FITNESS FUNCTION, finally armed.

         devloop_yield.py was written in S73/S74 as the metric the RSI loop
         selects on, and then scheduled NOWHERE. No plist, no timer, no runner
         command, no caller anywhere in the tree. It ran once by hand and the
         ledger has been going stale ever since: stall-check read 3 days on
         2026-08-27 and 7 days by 2026-08-31, degrading with nothing to stop it.

         So the loop had a fitness function it never computed. Buddy's own
         framing in S74 was that "keep it only if better" is meaningless without
         a "better" — and the better was not being measured.

         WHY 00:00. window-audit picked it as the next free CIRRUS slot, and the
         time also has to be right semantically, which the audit cannot judge:
         it must run AFTER com.cirrus.devloop (21:30, done by ~21:45) so it sees
         the night's builds, and BEFORE com.cirrus.devreport (06:30) so the
         morning report can carry a fresh number. 00:00 satisfies all three.

         The job is OFFLINE — it reads logs/dev-loop/builds.json and writes one
         JSONL line. No network, so it competes with nothing on the line, and
         the 08:00-16:00 weekday internet rule does not apply to it.

         A LaunchDAEMON in /Library/LaunchDaemons bootstrapped into the `system`
         domain, NOT a user LaunchAgent: CIRRUS runs with nobody logged in, so
         there is no gui/501 domain and an agent plist would never load (T43).

         NOTE the absence of any double hyphen in this comment. XML forbids one
         inside a comment; plutil accepts it anyway and a strict XML parser does
         not, so a plist can pass `plutil -lint` and still be malformed (T46). -->
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.cirrus.devloopyield</string>
    <key>UserName</key>
    <string>buddy</string>
    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>HOME</key>
        <string>/Users/buddy</string>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    </dict>
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/usr/bin/python3</string>
        <string>/Users/buddy/projects/cirrus-digest/devloop_yield.py</string>
    </array>
    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <dict>
        <key>Hour</key>
        <integer>0</integer>
        <key>Minute</key>
        <integer>0</integer>
    </dict>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/buddy/projects/cirrus-digest/logs/devloopyield-launchd.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/buddy/projects/cirrus-digest/logs/devloopyield-launchd.log</string>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
